<view class="page"><view class="title">历史报告</view><view class="caption space">只在当前微信身份下可见。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="skeleton space-lg"></view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="space-lg"><view class="error" role="alert">{{error}}</view><button class="btn btn-secondary space" bindtap="fetch">重新加载</button></view><view wx:elif="{{!records.length}}" class="center-state"><ui-icon name="note" color="muted" size="72" /><view class="section-title">还没有生活配置报告</view><view class="caption">从一份属于自己的答案开始。</view><button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onStart">去测一次</button></view><view wx:else class="space-lg"><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="card record"><button class="record-open" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onOpen"><view class="grow"><view class="caption">{{item.dateText}}</view><view class="section-title record-title">{{item.personaTitle}}</view><view class="caption">{{item.rankHeadline}}</view></view><ui-icon name="chevron" color="muted" size="30" /></button><view class="record-bottom"><text class="eyebrow">综合指数 <text class="num">{{item.scoreText}}</text></text><button class="text-btn" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{deleting === item.id}}" bindtap="onDelete">{{deleting === item.id ? '正在删除' : '删除报告'}}</button></view></view></view></view>
